    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack Properties are delighted to present 2 Brooklands to the market, an impressive four-bedroom detached dormer bungalow ideally located in the heart of Clane. Presented in good condition throughout, this spacious and versatile home offers well-proportioned accommodation, making it an excellent choice for families or those seeking a flexible and practical living environment.\n\nThe property is thoughtfully laid out over two floors. On the ground floor, the accommodation comprises a generously proportioned kitchen/dining room featuring a beautiful fully fitted kitchen, a comfortable sitting room ideal for family relaxation, guest WC, utility room, and a particularly useful downstairs bedroom with ensuite facilities. Upstairs, there are three further spacious bedrooms, one of which benefit from an ensuite bathroom, together with a family bathroom.\n\nThe property also boasts an impressive B3 BER energy rating, reflecting the home's energy efficiency and gas fired central heating.\n\nExternally, the property is approached via a cobblelock driveway providing ample off-street parking, together with a convenient pedestrian side entrance. To the rear is a private, south-west facing garden, beautifully enhanced by mature shrubbery, established planting and cobblelock pathways, providing an attractive and peaceful outdoor space.\n\nBrooklands is a highly regarded and popular development, situated just a short stroll from Clane village and its excellent range of amenities. Residents can enjoy easy access to a variety of shops, including Lidl, Aldi and Dunnes Stores, along with schools, church, pubs, cafés, restaurants, boutiques and an extensive selection of sporting and recreational facilities. No 2 Brooklands is located at the front of the development and only 1 /2 mins to the bus stop.\n\nClane is ideally positioned approximately 9km from Naas and 28km from Dublin, while also offering excellent access to major road networks and public transport commuter routes, making it an attractive location for both families and commuters.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the space, versatility and location this wonderful home has to offer.\n\nViewings can be arranged by contacting DNG McCormack Properties on 045 832535."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 5.52m x 2.36m\nTimber flooring, coving, understairs storage, alarm panel, wide and welcoming\n\nSitting Room - 3.60m x 5.53m\nTimber flooring, coving, bay window, solid fuel stove fireplace on granite hearth & cast iron surround\n\nGuest WC - 1.75m x 1.76m\nCeramic tiled floor and wall areas, WC, WHB, window\n\nKitchen - 3.57m x 7.44m\nTimber flooring, modern kitchen units at floor and eye level with integrated appliances, granite worktops, tiled splashback, French doors to rear garden, coving\n\nUtility Room - 1.77m x 1.68m\nCeramic tiled flooring, plumbed, window, fully fitted units, back door\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.13m x 3.96m\nGround floor, timber flooring, built in floor to ceiling wardrobes, front aspect\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.76m x 1.74m\nCeramic tiled floor and wall areas, wc, whb, step in shower unit, extractor\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.15m x 4.22m\nTimber flooring, built in floor to ceiling wardrobes, front aspect\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.65m x 2.83m\nTiled floor and wall areas, WC, whb, step in electric shower unit, velux window\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.82m x 4.71m\nTimber flooring, built in floor to ceiling wardrobes, walk in hotpress\n\nBedroom 4/ Office - 2.73m x 3.40m\nTimber flooring, built in wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 2.88m x 1.94m\nCeramic tiled floor and walls, WC, WHB, bath with over head shower\n\n"
      },
